msgid "You are now selling items in the markets of <if ($n1 == 10)>the <sheet Town $n1 0><else><sheet Town $n1 0></if>."
msgstr "Теперь вы продаёте товары на рынках <if ($n1 == 10)>города <sheet Town $n1 0><else><sheet Town $n1 0></if>."

#. ja: <sheet Town $n1 0>マーケットへの出品が停止されました。
#. de: Du verkaufst nun keine Gegenstände mehr auf dem Markt von <sheet Town $n1 0>.
#. fr: Vos objets ont été retirés de la vente à <sheet Town $n1 0>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 10)>the <sheet Town $n1 0><else><sheet Town $n1 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
