msgctxt "LogMessage:626:0:5"
msgid "You reclaim <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы получаете обратно: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."

#. ja: 所持品がいっぱいのためアイテムを受け取れません。
#. de: Du konntest den Gegenstand nicht entnehmen, weil dein Inventar voll ist.
#. fr: Impossible d'obtenir le ou les objets. Il n'y a pas assez de place dans votre inventaire.
msgctxt "LogMessage:627:0:5"
msgid "Insufficient inventory space. Could not reclaim item."
msgstr "Не удалось забрать предмет. В инвентаре нет места."

#. ja: 所持品の中に1つしか持てないRARE属性アイテムです。すでに所持しているため今は受け取れません。
#. de: Du konntest den Gegenstand nicht entnehmen, weil du denselben seltenen Gegenstand bereits im Inventar hast.
#. fr: Impossible d'obtenir l'objet. Vous possédez déjà un exemplaire de cet objet unique.
msgctxt "LogMessage:628:0:5"
msgid "Unable to reclaim item. You may not possess more than one of any unique item."
msgstr "Нельзя забрать предмет. У вас уже есть такой уникальный предмет, а иметь их можно только по одному."

#. ja: 装備中のアイテムは収納できません。
#. de: Du kannst keine Gegenstände ablegen, die du gerade ausgerüstet hast.
#. fr: Impossible de ranger un objet équipé.
msgctxt "LogMessage:629:0:5"
msgid "Unable to store gear currently equipped."
msgstr "Нельзя хранить надетое снаряжение."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>の攻撃  <if $gn8><sheet ObjStr $gn8 0><else>{$gs3}</if>はレジストした！
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn8><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>widerstehst<else>widersteht</if> der Attacke.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)>vous<else><if $gn8><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if (2 == 8)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if $gn6><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs3><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs3></if></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>résistez<else>résiste</if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 8, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>resist<else>resists</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:630:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>resist<else>resists</if>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)>Вы<else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>сопротивляетесь<else>сопротивляется</if>."

#. ja:    <if $gn8><sheet ObjStr $gn8 0><else>{$gs3}</if>は<num $n2><if ($n3 == 0)><else><if ($n3 > 0)>(+<num $n3>%)<else>(<num $n3>%)</if></if>ＧＰ回復。
#. de:    <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn8><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>regenerierst<else>regeneriert</if> <num $n2><if ($n3 == 0)><else><if ($n3 > 0)>(+<num $n3>%)<else>(<num $n3>%)</if></if> SP.
#. fr:    <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)>vous<else><if $gn8><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if (2 == 8)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if $gn6><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs3><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs3></if></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>récupérez<else>récupère</if> <num $n2><if ($n3 == 0)><else><if ($n3 > 0)>(+<num $n3>%)<else>(<num $n3>%)</if></if> PR.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 8, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>recover<else>recovers</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 == 0)><else><if ($n3 > 0)><nbsp>(+<num $n3>%)<else><nbsp>(<num $n3>%)</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n3 > 0)><nbsp>(+<num $n3>%)<else><nbsp>(<num $n3>%)</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
